        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 251.91,
          "end": 255.9,
          "en": "Now this concept is called autoboxing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 255.9,
          "end": 257.79,
          "en": "So this concept is called boxing, not autoboxing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 257.79,
          "end": 259.08,
          "en": "This concept is called boxing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 259.08,
          "end": 261.48,
          "en": "because you are taking a primitive value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 261.48,
          "end": 264,
          "en": "and storing that in a primitive object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 264,
          "end": 266.97,
          "en": "or in a wrapper object, in a class object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 266.97,
          "end": 269.04,
          "en": "That is called a boxing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 269.04,
          "end": 271.38,
          "en": "Now since this is so important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 271.38,
          "end": 274.47,
          "en": "what they've done is you can directly assign NUM now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 274.47,
          "end": 277.05,
          "en": "so this boxing is happening automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 277.05,
          "end": 280.11,
